L["Demonology with Soul Link, played with a Voidwalker for the whole climb. Demonic Embrace, Fel Vitality and Demonic Aegis raise your health and armor early, Improved Voidwalker makes the pet a sturdier damage sponge, and Soul Link at 30 sends 30% of every hit you take to the pet. Keep Fear and your DoTs on the target, let the Voidwalker hold the enemy melee, and use Fel Domination to bring a pet back instantly if it dies mid-fight. Felhunter is the swap against casters (Spell Lock). After Soul Link you finish Demonology (Demonic Knowledge, Master Demonologist) and then fill Affliction for instant Corruption, Suppression, Curse of Exhaustion and Nightfall. You win by lasting longer than the other player, not by bursting them; expect slower kills than the Nightfall build. Demonic Sacrifice is not taken because it removes the pet that Soul Link needs."] = "帶靈魂鏈結的惡魔學識，整個升級過程都搭配虛空行者。惡魔之擁、惡魔活力和惡魔庇護在早期提高你的生命值和護甲，強化虛空行者讓寵物成為更耐打的承傷者，30級的靈魂鏈結會把你受到的每次攻擊傷害的30%轉給寵物。讓目標保持恐懼術和你的持續傷害效果，讓虛空行者擋住敵人的近戰，如果寵物在戰鬥中死亡，就用惡魔支配立刻召回。面對施法者時換成惡魔獵犬（法術封鎖）。取得靈魂鏈結後先點完惡魔學識（惡魔知識、惡魔學識大師），再把剩餘點數補在痛苦系，取得瞬發腐蝕術、鎮壓、疲勞詛咒和夜幕。你靠比對手撐得更久來取勝，而不是靠爆發擊殺；擊殺速度會比夜幕配置慢。不點惡魔犧牲，因為它會移除靈魂鏈結所需要的寵物。"
