L["Feral with a small Restoration tail (Furor, Natural Shapeshifter) for shifting. Feral Swiftness and Brutal Impact come first (faster Cat, a Bash on a shorter cooldown), then Feral Charge at 20 to stop a caster or runner (Bear Form only), Sharpened Claws and Shredding Attacks for cheap Shreds, and Shifting Power at 26 to turn mana back into Energy after a fight or a shift. Predatory Strikes and Natural Instinct add burst, and Berserk at 41 lets Primal Bite hit three targets with no cooldown. Opener: Prowl, Pounce from behind, Shred, then Ferocious Bite at five combo points. Shapeshifting frees you from roots and snares, so shift out, then back to Cat and use Shifting Power to refill Energy. Tiger's Fury is gone from the trainer, and the early levels are weak until Cat Form at 20."] = "野性天賦搭配少量恢復系天賦（激怒、自然變身）用於變身。先點野性迅捷和野蠻衝撞（獵豹更快，重擊的冷卻時間更短），然後20級取得野性衝鋒來攔住施法者或逃跑的人（僅限熊形態），再點鋒利獸爪和撕碎攻擊讓撕碎更省能量，26級取得 Shifting Power，在戰鬥或變身之後把法力轉回能量。猛獸攻擊和自然本能增加爆發，41級的狂暴讓 Primal Bite 可以無冷卻地打中三個目標。開場：潛行，從背後突襲，撕碎，然後在五點連擊點數時使用兇猛撕咬。變身可以解除定身和減速，所以先變出去，再變回獵豹並用 Shifting Power 補滿能量。猛虎之怒已不在訓練師處，而且在20級取得獵豹形態之前，前期較為弱勢。"
