L["Frost: Dungeon Leveling"] = "冰霜：地城練功"
L["Frost: Solo Leveling"] = "冰霜：單人練功"
L["Frostbite"] = "霜寒刺骨"
L["Full Enhancement: Thundering Strikes and Mental Dexterity first, Shamanistic Focus at 20 (shocks -45% mana), Stormstrike at 25, Flurry, then Maelstrom Weapon and Rage of the Farseer; Toughness, Guardian Totems and Lightning Shield for survival. Fastest solo kills (about 95-126 per hour) with the lowest rest of the four studied specs, in mail, with Healing Wave and Lightning Shield."] = "全增強：先點雷鳴猛擊和心靈迅敏，20級點薩滿之凝（震擊法力消耗-45%），25級點風暴打擊，接著是亂舞，然後是氣漩武器和先知之怒；堅韌、守護圖騰和閃電之盾提高生存。單刷擊殺最快（每小時約95-126隻），在研究過的四種專精中休息最少，穿鎖甲，並有治療波和閃電之盾。"
