L["Level-60 AoE farming on packs of 4-5 mobs, roughly 3.5x the kills of single-target in our rough model, but risky. Two ways: the Voidwalker holds the pack while you Rain of Fire, or you Hellfire in the middle with Soul Link passing 30% of your damage to the demon. Demonology for Soul Link, Demonic Embrace and Master Demonologist (Voidwalker: less damage taken), then defensive Destruction: Molten Skin, Intensity (no pushback while channelling), Agonizing Flames and Cataclysm. Keep Healthstones handy and don't pull more than 5."] = "60級範圍刷怪，一次4-5隻，在我們的粗略模型中擊殺數約為單體的3.5倍，但有風險。兩種打法：讓虛空行者抓住整群怪你放火焰之雨，或你站在中間放地獄烈焰，靠靈魂鏈結把你受到的30%傷害轉給惡魔。點惡魔學識系的靈魂鏈結、惡魔之擁和惡魔學識大師（虛空行者：受到的傷害降低），然後點防禦向的毀滅天賦：熔火之膚、強烈（引導時不會被打斷延遲）、苦惱之焰和災變。備好治療石，一次別拉超過5隻。"
L["Level-60 AoE farming with a one-hander and shield (Prot 38 / Ret 13): gather 15-20 normal mobs, drop Consecration, keep Holy Shield up and let Retribution Aura (30 + 10% of your spell power on every hit you take) do most of the killing. Holy Shield and Templar's Bulwark are what let you pull big packs; Improved Seal of Fury and Shield Specialization keep your mana going; Pursuit of Justice gathers the next pack faster. Spell power is your best stat by far, then block, dodge, parry and Defense."] = "60級範圍刷怪，使用單手武器加盾牌（防護38 / 懲戒13）：聚集15-20隻普通怪，放奉獻，保持神聖之盾，讓懲戒光環（你每次被擊中造成30 + 你法術能量10%的傷害）負責大部分擊殺。神聖之盾和聖殿騎士之壁壘讓你能拉大群怪；強化憤怒聖印和盾牌專精維持你的法力；正義追擊讓你更快聚集下一群怪。法術能量是你最好的屬性，遙遙領先，其次是格擋、閃躲、招架和防禦。"
L["Level-60 AoE farming with a one-hander and shield. In the sim a Protection warrior kills 3-5 level-60 mobs about as fast as Arms or Fury but takes a third of the damage, so it hardly needs to eat: about 200 mobs an hour on 5-mob pulls against 150 for Fury. Gather a pack, Thunder Clap and Demoralizing Shout, Revenge and Shield Slam on cooldown, Cleave with spare rage. The raid tank's talents with Improved Sunder Armor in place of Defiance (threat doesn't matter alone)."] = "60級範圍刷怪，使用單手武器加盾牌。模擬中，防護戰士擊殺3-5隻60級怪的速度與武器或狂怒差不多，但承受的傷害只有三分之一，所以幾乎不用吃東西：每次拉5隻時每小時約200隻，狂怒為150隻。聚集一群怪，雷霆一擊和挫志怒吼，冷卻好就用復仇和盾牌猛擊，多餘的怒氣用順劈斬。天賦與團隊坦克相同，但以強化破甲攻擊取代挑釁（單刷時仇恨無所謂）。"
L["Level-60 AoE farming: gather a big pack, keep it slowed with Improved Blizzard and Permafrost, freeze it with Frost Nova (Cold Snap for a second Nova), and Blizzard it down. The AoE leveling talents with Ice Barrier, Ice Block and Frost Warding in place of Improved Cone of Cold, for safer big pulls: about 12 mobs a pack and 580 mobs an hour in our rough model. Arcane Concentration clearcasts and Frost Channeling keep drinking short; Crit, Intellect and Mp5 matter more than Spell Power here."] = "60級範圍刷怪：聚集一大群怪，用強化暴風雪和極寒冰霜保持減速，用冰霜新星凍住（急速冷卻可再放一次新星），再用暴風雪清掉。天賦與範圍練功相同，但以寒冰護體、寒冰屏障和冰霜護罩取代強化冰錐術，讓大量拉怪更安全：在我們的粗略模型中每群約12隻，每小時約580隻。秘法專注的節能施法和冰霜導能讓喝水時間更短；在這裡致命一擊、智力和每5秒法力比法術能量更重要。"
L["Level-60 Shadow farming on packs of 4-5 mobs: Shadow Word: Pain on each, Devouring Plague (Devouring Contagion spreads it when a mob dies), Power Word: Shield (Soul Warding: shorter cooldown) and Psychic Scream to fear them off you (Improved Psychic Scream), Vampiric Embrace and Spirit Tap to recover. Risky: about 225 mobs an hour in our rough model (single-target about 120), but a pack out-damages your health unless you chain fears and shields well. Start with 3 mobs."] = "60級暗影刷怪，一次4-5隻：每隻上暗言術：痛，噬靈瘟疫（吞噬疫病會在怪物死亡時擴散它），真言術：盾（靈魂結界：冷卻更短），用心靈尖嘯把怪恐懼開（強化心靈尖嘯），吸血鬼的擁抱和精神分流用於恢復。有風險：在我們的粗略模型中每小時約225隻（單體約120隻），但除非恐懼和護盾銜接得好，一群怪的傷害會超過你的生命力。從3隻開始。"
L["Level-60 pack farming as a shield tank: pull about 4 normal mobs, drop Magma Totem, Fire Nova on cooldown, Lightning Shield and Flame Shock, Rockbiter Weapon on your one-hander. Survival over threat: Toughness, Anticipation, Guardian Totems and Improved Reincarnation instead of Stormstrike. About 170 mobs an hour in our rough model against 78 single-target as Enhancement; 5 mobs is about the limit without healing mid-fight. Levels as a tank (mana talents first)."] = "以盾牌坦克身分在60級刷成群的怪：拉約4隻普通怪，放熔岩圖騰，冷卻好就放火焰新星，閃電之盾和烈焰震擊，單手武器上石化武器。生存優先於仇恨：以堅韌、預知、守護圖騰和強化復生取代風暴打擊。在我們的粗略模型中每小時約170隻，增強單刷則為78隻；不在戰鬥中補血的話，5隻大約是極限。以坦克身分練功（法力天賦優先）。"
