L["Pure Frost for open-world PvP from level 10. Improved Frostbolt and Elemental Precision make Frostbolt fast and reliable, then Ice Lance, Frostbite, Improved Frost Nova and Ice Block (by level 26) give you root, freeze and an emergency escape. Shatter comes at 27-29, so Nova or a Frostbite freeze followed by Ice Lance and Frostbolt is your burst. Fingers of Frost and Winter's Chill add crits later, Ice Barrier at 40 stops interrupts, and Cold Snap resets Nova and Ice Block. Open with a slow, keep range with Nova and Blink, and Ice Block when a melee class or a group catches you; weak play below 20 is expected."] = "從10級起專走純冰霜，適用於野外PvP。強化寒冰箭和元素準確讓寒冰箭又快又穩，然後冰霜長矛、霜寒刺骨、強化冰霜新星和寒冰屏障（26級前）給你定身、冰凍和緊急脫身的手段。碎冰在27至29級取得，所以新星或霜寒刺骨的冰凍後接冰霜長矛和寒冰箭就是你的爆發。冰霜之指和深冬之寒之後增加致命一擊，40級的寒冰護體可以防止被打斷，急速冷卻會重置冰霜新星和寒冰屏障。用減速開場，靠冰霜新星和閃現術保持距離，被近戰職業或一群人追上時就用寒冰屏障；20級以前表現較弱是正常的。"
L["Pure Frost: Improved Frostbolt and Elemental Precision for speed, then Frostbite plus Ice Lance and Shatter for free-freeze burst, Frost Channeling for short drinks, Ice Barrier at 40. Nova kiting and Frostbite freezes handle an accidental second mob; AoE/Fire cost either survival or mana."] = "純冰霜：強化寒冰箭和元素準確提高速度，接著是霜寒刺骨加上冰霜長矛和碎冰打出免費冰凍爆發，冰霜導能縮短喝水時間，40級點寒冰護體。冰霜新星放風箏和霜寒刺骨的冰凍能應付意外多出的第二隻怪；範圍/火焰配置則要犧牲生存或法力。"
L["Pure Restoration. Nature's Focus first, because the 14% per rank chance not to lose a cast to damage matters most when people are hitting you; Naturalist shortens Healing Touch. Reflection and Gift of the Earthmother (shorter global cooldown on Rejuvenation and Swiftmend) come by the mid-20s, then Swiftmend at 25 and Nature's Swiftness at level 30, the instant heal or Entangling Roots for the emergency. Gift of Nature and Improved Rejuvenation raise HoT healing; Improved Regrowth at 35 and Wild Growth at 40 add burst and group healing. Cast lower ranks to save mana, keep Rejuvenation on yourself and your target, and use Entangling Roots on melee. Shapeshifting frees you from roots and snares, but cancels your heals. Furor and Natural Shapeshifter fill the end."] = "純恢復。先點自然集中，因為每級有14%的機率讓施法不被傷害打斷，在有人攻擊你時最重要；強化治療之觸（Naturalist）縮短治療之觸的施法時間。反射和大地之母賜福（縮短回春術和迅癒的公共冷卻時間）在20級中段前取得，然後25級取得迅癒，30級取得自然迅捷，用於緊急情況下的瞬發治療或糾纏根鬚。自然賜福和強化回春術提高持續治療的效果；35級的強化癒合和40級的野性痊癒增加爆發和群體治療。施放低等級法術以節省法力，讓回春術保持在自己和目標身上，並對近戰敵人使用糾纏根鬚。變身可以解除定身和減速，但會取消你的治療。激怒和自然變身填補最後的點數。"
