L["Ret dip for Deflection and Holy Conduit, with Iron Creed, Benediction and Reckoning: cheaper seals, Judgements and Consecration for long fights. In the simulator's 3-minute boss fight it makes about 5% less threat and takes about 4% more damage than Vanguard, which runs out of mana first."] = "點懲戒系的偏斜和神聖導體，加上鐵之教條、祈福和清算：聖印、審判和奉獻更便宜，適合長時間戰鬥。在模擬器的3分鐘首領戰中，它的仇恨比先鋒少約5%，承受傷害多約4%，但先鋒會先耗盡法力。"
