L["Shield-and-Seal-of-Fury leveler (Prot 41 / Ret 10): Consecration pack-pulls with near-zero rest from Shield Specialization and Improved Seal of Fury mana, Templar's Bulwark and Holy Shield as safety nets. Single-target kills are about a third slower than Retribution, but pulls of 2-3 mobs and an accidental add cost almost nothing."] = "盾牌加憤怒聖印的練功配置（防護41 / 懲戒10）：用奉獻拉成群的怪，盾牌專精和強化憤怒聖印的法力回復讓休息幾乎為零，聖殿騎士之壁壘和神聖之盾作為保命手段。單體擊殺比懲戒慢約三分之一，但拉2-3隻怪或意外多出一隻怪幾乎沒有代價。"
L["Shifting Power"] = "Shifting Power"
L["Shredding Attacks"] = "撕碎攻擊"
L["Silence"] = "沉默"
L["Silent Resolve"] = "無聲消退"
L["Sniper Shot"] = "狙擊"
L["Solo"] = "單人"
