L["Subtlety 31 / Combat 20 with swords or maces, built for open-world and battleground fights. The first 21 points are all Subtlety: Master of Deception and Camouflage for stealth approaches, Dirty Tricks and Elusiveness for cheap Sap/Blind and a shorter Vanish, Initiative and Premeditation so Cheap Shot or Ambush leads straight into a Kidney Shot, then Hemorrhage at 30. After that Preparation resets Vanish, Sprint, Evasion and Kick, and Combat adds Lightning Reflexes, Endurance (shorter Sprint and Evasion cooldowns), Improved Sprint (a chance to shed snares) and Improved Kick (a silence). Open from stealth with Cheap Shot, Hemorrhage to build, Kidney Shot to finish; save Vanish and Sprint to leave a bad fight. Early on you are weak until about 20, which is fine."] = "使用劍或錘的敏銳31 / 戰鬥20，專為野外和戰場戰鬥設計。前21點全部點敏銳：欺詐大師和偽裝用於潛行接近，卑鄙手段和飄忽不定讓悶棍／致盲更省能量並縮短消失的冷卻時間，先發制人和預謀讓偷襲或伏擊能直接接上腎擊，然後30級取得出血。之後伺機待發重置消失、疾跑、閃避和腳踢，戰鬥系加入閃電反射、耐久（縮短疾跑和閃避的冷卻時間）、強化疾跑（有機會擺脫減速）和強化腳踢（沉默）。從潛行用偷襲開場，用出血累積，用腎擊收尾；把消失和疾跑留著脫離不利的戰鬥。前期到約20級都比較弱，這是正常的。"
L["Summon Hawk"] = "召喚獵鷹"
L["Survival Tactics"] = "求生戰術"
L["Survivalist"] = "生存技能專家"
L["Sweeping Strikes"] = "橫掃攻擊"
L["Swift Judgement"] = "迅捷審判"
L["Swiftmend"] = "迅癒"
L["Talent Builds"] = "天賦配置"
L["Talent Order"] = "天賦順序"
L["Talents could not be read yet."] = "暫時無法讀取天賦。"
L["Tank"] = "坦克"
L["Tank: Dungeon Leveling"] = "坦克：地城練功"
L["Tanking groups through dungeons from 15 to 59 with a one-hander and shield. Redoubt first, then Precision so your attacks and seal procs land (missed attacks lose threat), and Improved Seal of Fury at 20: it returns more mana the higher the attacker's level, and dungeon mobs are often above yours. Shield Specialization and Improved Righteous Fury next, Swift Judgement at 25 as an emergency taunt (Judgement taunts under Seal of Fury), Templar's Bulwark at 30, then Reckoning: its extra attacks after blocks give the threat you're short of in the 30s. Holy Shield at 40, then Benediction and Holy Conduit for cheaper Consecration on packs, then Iron Creed. Use Consecration from 20 to hold packs."] = "從15到59級使用單手武器加盾牌在地城中坦怪。先點盾牌壁壘，接著點精確讓你的攻擊和聖印觸發命中（未命中會損失仇恨），20級點強化憤怒聖印：攻擊者等級越高，它回復的法力越多，而地城怪物常常比你高等。接著是盾牌專精和強化正義之怒，25級點迅捷審判作為緊急嘲諷（憤怒聖印下的審判具有嘲諷效果），30級點聖殿騎士之壁壘，然後是清算：格擋後的額外攻擊能補足你在30多級時欠缺的仇恨。40級點神聖之盾，接著點祈福和神聖導體讓對付成群怪的奉獻更便宜，然後是鐵之教條。從20級起用奉獻穩住成群的怪。"
L["Tanking groups through dungeons from 15 to 59. Avoidance first (Shield Specialization, Deflection, Anticipation): the healer's mana is what slows a group down. Improved Revenge and Improved Thunder Clap for pack threat, Improved Sunder Armor, Bastion, then Shield Slam and Cruelty. Thunder Clap and Demoralizing Shout on every pack so loose mobs stay on you, Revenge on cooldown, Sunder Armor on the kill target; Shield Block on bosses."] = "從15到59級在地城中坦怪。迴避優先（盾牌專精、偏斜、預知）：拖慢隊伍的是治療者的法力。強化復仇和強化雷霆一擊提供群體仇恨，接著是強化破甲攻擊、堡壘，然後是盾牌猛擊和殘忍。每群怪都用雷霆一擊和挫志怒吼，讓散怪留在你身上，冷卻好就用復仇，對擊殺目標用破甲攻擊；首領戰使用盾牌格擋。"
L["Tanking groups through dungeons in Bear Form (Balance 9 / Feral 32 / Restoration 10): Maul on most swings, Swipe on packs (Feral Instinct), Primal Bite on cooldown, Demoralizing Roar; Thick Hide, Feral Swiftness and Natural Reaction for survival, Blood Frenzy and Furor for rage. Weak below 16 (no Swipe yet), then about as fast as a Protection Warrior in our model."] = "以熊形態在地城中坦怪（平衡9 / 野性戰鬥32 / 恢復10）：大部分揮擊都用槌擊，成群的怪用揮擊（野性本能），冷卻好就用 Primal Bite，加上挫志咆哮；厚皮、野性迅捷和自然反應提高生存，血之狂暴和激怒提供怒氣。16級前較弱（還沒有揮擊），之後在我們的模型中速度與防護戰士相當。"
L["Tanking groups through dungeons with a one-hander, a shield and Rockbiter Weapon: Spirit Weapons adds 30% threat while Rockbiter is on and lets you parry. Earth Shock for single-target threat, Fire Nova (and Magma Totem from 26) on packs, Lightning Shield for damage on every hit taken, Stormstrike, with Improved Stormstrike resetting it on dodges and parries. Anticipation and Guardian Totems (Stoneskin) for survival; Water Shield, Mindfulness and Tidal Focus keep the mana coming. Weaker than a Warrior below 25, then about 10-17% faster runs in our model. Gear Judge has no level-60 Shaman tank profile yet: at 60 it uses the farming weights."] = "使用單手武器、盾牌和石化武器在地城中坦怪：石化武器開啟時，魂化武器使仇恨提高30%，並讓你可以招架。單體仇恨用大地震擊，成群的怪用火焰新星（26級起加上熔岩圖騰），閃電之盾讓你每次被擊中都造成傷害，風暴打擊配合強化風暴打擊在閃躲和招架時重置冷卻。預知和守護圖騰（石甲）提高生存；水之盾、正念和潮汐集中維持法力。25級前比戰士弱，之後在我們的模型中跑本快約10-17%。Gear Judge 尚無60級薩滿坦克設定檔：60級時使用刷怪權重。"
L["Templar's Bulwark"] = "聖殿騎士之壁壘"
L["The Affliction talents ordered for groups: Improved Corruption, Suppression and Malediction first, then Nightfall, Pandemic and Malevolence. Corruption and Bane of Agony on every mob of a pack, Shadow Bolt to fill; Life Tap freely, the healer covers it. Mind your threat: DoTs on many mobs add up."] = "痛苦天賦按組隊需求排序：先點強化腐蝕術、鎮壓和詛咒，接著是夜幕、災疫和惡意。對一群怪的每一隻上腐蝕術和痛苦災厄，用暗影箭補空檔；生命分流盡量用，治療者會補。注意你的仇恨：多隻怪身上的DoT會累積起來。"
L["The Cat raid talents in a questing order: Genesis, Nature's Reach, Nature's Majesty and Heart of the Wild first, then Ferocity, Sharpened Claws and Savage Fury, Shifting Power at 34 (turns mana into Energy), Predatory Strikes and Natural Instinct, Rend and Tear, then the Restoration filler and Berserk. Claw and Rake from the front, Ferocious Bite at five combo points; don't powershift (Furor is gone). About 3% faster than the old Furor build in our model, and no respec at 60."] = "獵豹團隊天賦的解任務順序：先點起源、自然延伸、自然威嚴和野性之心，接著是兇暴、鋒利獸爪和野蠻暴怒，34級點 Shifting Power（把法力轉為能量），猛獸攻擊和自然本能，碎裂撕扯，然後是恢復系的填充天賦和狂暴。從正面用爪擊和掃擊，五點連擊點數用兇猛撕咬；別變身回能（激怒已移除）。在我們的模型中比舊的激怒配置快約3%，而且60級不必重置天賦。"
L["The Cat raid talents ordered for leveling through dungeons, where you stand behind the mob and can Shred: Shredding Attacks and Shifting Power in the early 30s, then Predatory Strikes, Rend and Tear and Blood Frenzy. Uses Gear Judge's new Cat dungeon weights."] = "獵豹團隊天賦的地城練功順序，在地城中你站在怪物背後，可以用撕碎：30級出頭點撕碎攻擊和 Shifting Power，接著是猛獸攻擊、碎裂撕扯和血之狂暴。使用 Gear Judge 新的獵豹地城權重。"
L["The Enhancement raid talents ordered for leveling through dungeons: Thundering Strikes, Mental Dexterity and Elemental Weapons first, Stormstrike at 25 and Flurry, then the Elemental shock talents (Reverberation, Call of Flame, Elemental Devastation) before Maelstrom Weapon and Rage of the Farseer. Use Windfury Weapon in groups, not Rockbiter: Spirit Weapons cuts your threat by 30% while Rockbiter is off. Let the tank build threat before Stormstrike and Earth Shock."] = "增強團隊天賦的地城練功順序：先點雷鳴猛擊、心靈迅敏和元素武器，25級點風暴打擊，接著是亂舞，然後在氣漩武器和先知之怒之前先點元素系的震擊天賦（迴響、烈焰召喚、元素破壞）。組隊時用風怒武器，不要用石化武器：沒開石化武器時，魂化武器會使你的仇恨降低30%。先讓坦克累積仇恨再用風暴打擊和大地震擊。"
L["The level-60 Arms build (Arms 34 / Fury 17) for raids, with a two-hander. Keep Rend up so Bloodthrill can proc Overpower, use Overpower whenever it lights up, Mortal Strike on cooldown, Slam and Spearing Strike to fill. In the wowsims Forever sim it beats Fury by about 12% (dual wield) and 20% (two-hander). Hit matters most until you reach the cap, then Crit and Strength."] = "60級團隊用武器配置（武器34 / 狂怒17），使用雙手武器。保持撕裂讓鮮血快感能觸發壓制，壓制一亮就用，冷卻好就用致死打擊，猛擊和穿刺打擊補空檔。在 wowsims Forever 模擬中，它比狂怒強約12%（雙持）和20%（雙手武器）。達到上限前命中最重要，之後是致命一擊和力量。"
L["The level-60 Bear tank, same talents as Bear: Dungeon Leveling. In the wowsims Forever simulator it makes about the same threat as a Protection Warrior and takes about 7% less damage. Dire Bear Form multiplies your armor so much that the simulator stops counting more past about 5,000: Stamina, Agility and Dodge beat extra armor once you're there."] = "60級熊坦克，天賦與「熊：地城練功」相同。在 wowsims Forever 模擬器中，它的仇恨與防護戰士大致相同，承受的傷害少約7%。巨熊形態大幅倍增你的護甲，模擬器在約5,000以上就不再計入更多護甲：達到後耐力、敏捷和閃躲比額外護甲更好。"
L["The level-60 Beast Mastery build (BM 35 / MM 16) for raids. Summon Hawk on cooldown is the biggest single talent (about 4-6% of your damage in the simulator), then Bestial Discipline, Bestial Wrath, Ferocity and Unleashed Fury. Trueshot Aura in place of Intimidation, which bosses ignore. In the wowsims Forever simulator it beats Marksmanship by about 10% and Survival by about 20%. Hawks cost mana and Careful Aim turns your Intellect into Attack Power, so Intellect and Mp5 count more than Agility."] = "60級團隊用野獸控制配置（野獸控制35 / 射擊16）。冷卻好就施放召喚獵鷹，是影響最大的單一天賦（模擬器中約佔你傷害的4-6%），其次是野獸戒律、狂野怒火、兇暴和狂怒釋放。以強擊光環取代首領不受影響的脅迫。在 wowsims Forever 模擬器中，它比射擊強約10%，比生存強約20%。獵鷹會消耗法力，而仔細瞄準會把你的智力轉為攻擊強度，所以智力和每5秒法力比敏捷更重要。"
L["The level-60 Combat build (Assassination 18 / Combat 33) with swords. Keep Slice and Dice up, Sinister Strike to build combo points, Eviscerate at five; Adrenaline Rush and Blade Flurry on cooldown. Relentless Strikes, Improved Sinister Strike and Adrenaline Rush are worth the most. In the wowsims Forever simulator it beats Backstab daggers by about 4%, Mutilate by about 10% and Hemorrhage by about 14%. Agility is your best stat (about twice Attack Power), then Hit until the cap and Crit."] = "60級戰鬥配置（刺殺18 / 戰鬥33），使用劍。保持切割，用邪惡攻擊累積連擊點數，五點時用剔骨；冷卻好就用能量刺激和劍刃亂舞。無情打擊、強化邪惡攻擊和能量刺激價值最高。在 wowsims Forever 模擬器中，它比背刺匕首強約4%，比截肢強約10%，比出血強約14%。敏捷是你最好的屬性（約為攻擊強度的兩倍），其次是達到上限前的命中，然後是致命一擊。"
L["The level-60 Demonic Pact build (Affliction 5 / Demonology 31 / Destruction 15): sacrifice the Imp before the pull and keep its +15% Shadow buff while the Succubus is out (Demonic Pact), with Master Demonologist, Demonic Knowledge and Soul Link on top. Shadow Bolt with Bane and Ruin, Corruption and Bane of Agony up. In the wowsims Forever simulator it beats Affliction by about 19% and DS/Ruin by about 28%. Hit until the cap, then Spell Power and Crit."] = "60級惡魔契印配置（痛苦5 / 惡魔學識31 / 毀滅15）：開怪前犧牲小鬼，召出魅魔時仍保留它的暗影傷害+15%增益（惡魔契印），再加上惡魔學識大師、惡魔知識和靈魂鏈結。暗影箭配合災禍和毀滅，保持腐蝕術和痛苦災厄。在 wowsims Forever 模擬器中，它比痛苦強約19%，比惡魔犧牲/毀滅強約28%。達到上限前優先命中，之後是法術能量和致命一擊。"
L["The level-60 Discipline raid healer (Discipline 32 / Holy 19): Penance and Power Word: Shield, Renewed Hope and Divine Aegis on crits, Power Infusion for a caster, Binding Heal, Improved Healing. A strong single-target and tank healer; Holy heals more in total in our model, Discipline has the stronger utility."] = "60級戒律團隊治療（戒律32 / 神聖19）：懺悟和真言術：盾，嶄新希望和致命一擊觸發的神禦之盾，給施法者的注入能量，束縛治療，強化治療術。強力的單體與坦克治療；在我們的模型中神聖的總治療量更高，戒律則有更強的輔助能力。"
L["The level-60 Elemental build (Elemental 31 / Enhancement 11 / Restoration 9): Flame Shock up, Lava Burst on cooldown, Lightning Bolt to fill, dropping to a lower Lightning Bolt rank when mana runs short. Elemental is mana-hungry in Forever, so Mindfulness, Ancestral Knowledge, Shamanistic Focus and Totemic Focus come with it. About 42% behind Enhancement in the wowsims Forever simulator; Eye of the Storm and Elemental Reach are filler to reach Elemental Fury and Lava Burst."] = "60級元素配置（元素31 / 增強11 / 恢復9）：保持烈焰震擊，冷卻好就用熔岩爆發，閃電箭補空檔，法力不足時改用較低等級的閃電箭。在 Forever 中元素非常吃法力，所以搭配正念、先祖知識、薩滿之凝和圖騰集中。在 wowsims Forever 模擬器中落後增強約42%；暴風之眼和元素延伸是為了點到元素之怒和熔岩爆發的填充天賦。"
L["The level-60 Feral Cat build (Balance 9 / Feral 35 / Restoration 7): Shred from behind, Rake and Rip kept up, Ferocious Bite at five combo points, Shifting Power on cooldown (it turns mana into Energy). No Furor: in Forever it refunds no extra energy, so don't powershift. About 60% more damage than Balance in the wowsims Forever simulator. Same talents and order as Feral Cat: Solo Leveling."] = "60級野性獵豹配置（平衡9 / 野性戰鬥35 / 恢復7）：從背後撕碎，保持掃擊和撕扯，五點連擊點數用兇猛撕咬，冷卻好就用 Shifting Power（它把法力轉為能量）。不點激怒：在 Forever 中它不會回復額外能量，所以別變身回能。在 wowsims Forever 模擬器中傷害比平衡高約60%。天賦和順序與「野性獵豹：單人練功」相同。"
L["The level-60 Frost build (Arcane 18 / Frost 33) for raids. Bosses can't be frozen, so Fingers of Frost is what feeds Shatter and Ice Lance: cast Ice Lance whenever Fingers of Frost is up, Frostbolt otherwise. Fingers of Frost, Improved Frostbolt, Ice Shards and Ice Lance are worth the most. In the wowsims Forever simulator Arcane is within about 3% of it (ahead on the 2026-10-08 build) and Fire about 12% behind; Frost stays the raid build for its Winter's Chill and freezes. Hit is your best stat until the cap, then Spell Power and Crit."] = "60級團隊用冰霜配置（秘法18 / 冰霜33）。首領無法被冰凍，所以碎冰和冰霜長矛靠冰霜之指觸發：冰霜之指觸發時施放冰霜長矛，其餘時間用寒冰箭。冰霜之指、強化寒冰箭、寒冰碎片和冰霜長矛價值最高。在 wowsims Forever 模擬器中，秘法與它相差約3%（在 2026-10-08 版本中秘法領先），火焰落後約12%；冰霜因寒冬之咬和冰凍效果仍是團隊配置。達到上限前命中是你最好的屬性，之後是法術能量和致命一擊。"
L["The level-60 Holy raid healer (Discipline 20 / Holy 31) with Prayer of Mending: cast it on cooldown (it jumps five times), Greater Heal ranks for the tank, Flash Heal for spikes, Renew and Power Word: Shield on the move. Spiritual Guidance and Spiritual Healing, Improved Healing and Litany of Light for mana. Our healing model puts it about 15% ahead of Discipline in raids; downrank freely (Forever gives every rank the full bonus)."] = "60級神聖團隊治療（戒律20 / 神聖31），配合癒合禱言：冷卻好就施放（它會跳躍五次），坦克用各等級的強效治療術，突發傷害用快速治療，移動時用恢復和真言術：盾。精神導引和精神治療，強化治療術和聖光連禱節省法力。我們的治療模型顯示它在團隊中領先戒律約15%；盡量降級施放（Forever 讓每個等級都獲得完整加成）。"
L["The level-60 Moonkin build (Balance 33 / Feral 3 / Restoration 15): Moonfire and Insect Swarm up, Starfire to fill. Improved Starfire instead of Improved Wrath (the simulator's rotation never casts Wrath), Reflection for mana, Subtlety for threat. About 40% behind Cat in the wowsims Forever simulator. Replaces Balance: Leveling; it still levels as Balance, Moonkin Form at 42."] = "60級梟獸配置（平衡33 / 野性戰鬥3 / 恢復15）：保持月火術和蟲群，星火術補空檔。以強化星火術取代強化憤怒（模擬器的循環從不施放憤怒），反射提供法力，微妙降低仇恨。在 wowsims Forever 模擬器中落後獵豹約40%。取代「平衡：練功」；練功時仍以平衡為主，42級點梟獸形態。"
L["The level-60 Restoration healer (Balance 11 / Feral 5 / Restoration 35): Rejuvenation and Regrowth (Nature's Splendor makes both last longer), Wild Growth on groups, Swiftmend and Nature's Swiftness for emergencies. Your HoTs can't crit, so Crit is worth little; Spirit, Mp5 and Intellect lead. The Balance talents come first for damage while you quest. Downrank freely."] = "60級恢復治療（平衡11 / 野性戰鬥5 / 恢復35）：回春術和癒合（自然光采讓兩者持續更久），群體用野性痊癒，緊急時用迅癒和自然迅捷。你的HoT無法致命一擊，所以致命一擊價值很低；精神、每5秒法力和智力優先。解任務時先點平衡天賦提高傷害。盡量降級施放。"
L["The level-60 Restoration healer (Restoration 40 / Enhancement 11): Chain Heal on groups (Riptide the main target first: +25% on it), Healing Wave ranks for the tank, Lesser Healing Wave for spikes, Nature's Swiftness for emergencies. Water Shield gives mana back on heal crits, so Crit is worth far more than for other healers; Mana Tide, Mindfulness and Restorative Totems for mana. Thundering Strikes first for crit while you quest. Downrank freely."] = "60級恢復治療（恢復40 / 增強11）：群體用治療鍊（先對主要目標施放激流：治療鍊對其效果+25%），坦克用各等級的治療波，突發傷害用次級治療波，緊急時用自然迅捷。水之盾在治療致命一擊時回復法力，所以致命一擊的價值遠高於其他治療者；法力之潮圖騰、正念和恢復圖騰提供法力。解任務時先點雷鳴猛擊提高致命一擊。盡量降級施放。"
L["The level-60 Retribution build (Ret 33 / Holy 18) for raids, built around seal-twisting with Twist of Light at 40: keep Seal of Command up and put Seal of Righteousness up just before each swing, then Seal of Command again; the Echo Twist of Light leaves applies the replaced seal on your next swing, so every swing gets Righteousness damage and a Command chance. That's about 19% more damage than the same build without Twist of Light in the wowsims Forever simulator, but it means re-sealing before almost every swing. Open with Seal of the Crusader and Judgement (your melee hits keep it on the target), Judgement and Holy Strike on cooldown. Instrument of Law cuts your threat by 20%; Sanctified Judgement and Twist of Light's cheaper seals keep your mana going. Hit and Crit count most, then Strength, Spell Power and Agility."] = "60級團隊用懲戒配置（懲戒33 / 神聖18），圍繞40級的聖光折射進行聖印切換：保持命令聖印，在每次揮擊前一刻換上正義聖印，然後再換回命令聖印；聖光折射留下的迴響會在你下一次揮擊時套用被替換的聖印，因此每次揮擊都能造成正義傷害並有命令觸發機會。在 wowsims Forever 模擬器中，這比沒有聖光折射的相同配置多約19%傷害，但幾乎每次揮擊前都得重新上聖印。以十字軍聖印和審判開場（你的近戰命中會讓它保持在目標身上），冷卻好就用審判和神聖打擊。法之公器使你的仇恨降低20%；聖化審判和聖光折射讓聖印更便宜，維持你的法力。命中和致命一擊最重要，其次是力量、法術能量和敏捷。"
L["The level-60 Shadow build (Discipline 20 / Shadow 31) for raids: Mind Flay, Shadowform, Shadow Weaving and Darkness carry it. Keep Shadow Word: Pain and Shadow Weaving up, Mind Blast on cooldown, Mind Flay to fill; Vampiric Embrace heals your group. Shadow Affinity (less threat), Shadow Reach and Silence in place of the solo build's Spirit Tap and Improved Psychic Scream. In the wowsims Forever simulator Shadow out-damages Smite by about 35-60%."] = "60級團隊用暗影配置（戒律20 / 暗影31）：精神鞭笞、暗影形態、暗影之波和黑暗是核心。保持暗言術：痛和暗影之波，冷卻好就用心靈震爆，精神鞭笞補空檔；吸血鬼的擁抱治療你的隊伍。以暗影親和（降低仇恨）、暗影延伸和沉默取代單人配置的精神分流和強化心靈尖嘯。在 wowsims Forever 模擬器中，暗影的傷害比懲擊高約35-60%。"
L["The level-60 raid healer (Holy 32). Healing Light, Divine Favor, Reverence and Illumination are the core: before raid gear a Paladin healer runs short of mana long before running out of casting time, so Flash of Light is your main heal and Holy Light, Holy Shock and Light's Vigil are for spikes. Purifying Power and Benediction make Cleanse cheaper. Pursuit of Justice for moving in fights and Guardian's Favor for a shorter Blessing of Protection cooldown round it out."] = "60級團隊治療（神聖32）。治療之光、神恩術、崇敬和啟發是核心：在拿到團隊裝備前，聖騎士治療者遠在施法時間用完之前就會先缺法力，所以聖光閃現是你的主要治療，聖光術、神聖震擊和聖光戒備用於突發傷害。淨化能量和祈福讓清潔術更便宜。正義追擊方便戰鬥中移動，守護者的寵愛縮短保護祝福的冷卻，補足整個配置。"
L["The level-60 raid tank (Prot 38 with Deflection, Improved Heroic Strike and Cruelty). Shield Slam is about a third of your threat; Revenge whenever it lights up, Thunder Clap (Improved Thunder Clap makes it cheap) and Sunder Armor fill. Defiance and Focused Rage are the other big threat talents; Deflection and Anticipation cut the damage you take. In the sim it holds more threat and takes less damage than the Fury-Prot and Arms-Prot hybrids."] = "60級團隊坦克（防護38，搭配偏斜、強化英勇打擊和殘忍）。盾牌猛擊約佔你仇恨的三分之一；復仇一亮就用，雷霆一擊（強化雷霆一擊讓它很便宜）和破甲攻擊補空檔。挑釁和集中怒氣是其他重要的仇恨天賦；偏斜和預知降低你承受的傷害。模擬中，它的仇恨比狂怒-防護和武器-防護混合配置更高，承受的傷害也更少。"
L["The level-60 two-hander build (Elemental 19 / Enhancement 32): Stormstrike on cooldown, Flame Shock kept up and Earth Shock after each Stormstrike, Windfury Weapon. Elemental Devastation turns your shock crits into melee crits, Convection and Shamanistic Focus keep the shocks cheap, Improved Stormstrike gives casting regen. About 1.7 times the damage of Elemental in the wowsims Forever simulator. Levels well too: about 2.6% faster than Enhancement: Solo Leveling in our model."] = "60級雙手武器配置（元素19 / 增強32）：冷卻好就用風暴打擊，保持烈焰震擊，每次風暴打擊後用大地震擊，搭配風怒武器。元素破壞讓你的震擊致命一擊轉為近戰致命一擊，傳導和薩滿之凝讓震擊更便宜，強化風暴打擊提供施法回復。在 wowsims Forever 模擬器中傷害約為元素的1.7倍。練功也很強：在我們的模型中比「增強：單人練功」快約2.6%。"
L["This plugin needs WoW Forever's talent system and Sharpie's Gear Judge."] = "此插件需要 WoW Forever 的天賦系統和 Sharpie's Gear Judge。"
L["Thousand Cuts"] = "千刀萬剮"
L["Thundering Strikes"] = "雷鳴猛擊"
L["Tidal Focus"] = "潮汐集中"
L["Tidal Mastery"] = "潮汐專精"
L["Totemic Focus"] = "圖騰集中"
L["Toughness"] = "堅韌"
L["Tranquil Spirit"] = "寧靜之魂"
L["Twilight Focus"] = "暮光集中"
L["Twin Disciplines"] = "雙生戒律"
L["Twist of Light"] = "聖光折射"
L["Two-Handed Weapon Specialization"] = "雙手武器專精"
L["Two-handed Retribution for fighting players (Ret 33 / Holy 11 / Prot 7). The first 21 points are all Retribution: Seal of Command for burst, Repentance at 30 to incapacitate a humanoid, Pursuit of Justice for speed, Vindication to cut the target's attack power and Eye for an Eye against crit-heavy attackers. Then Two-Handed Weapon Specialization, Vengeance, Champion of the Light and Twist of Light for seal-twisting damage. Holy adds Improved Seals, Divine Strength, Unyielding Faith (shorter fears) and Voice of Truth (6 sec silence and interrupt immunity); Protection adds Toughness and Guardian's Favor for a shorter Blessing of Protection cooldown and a longer Blessing of Freedom. Reckoning is deliberately skipped."] = "用於對戰玩家的雙手懲戒（懲戒33 / 神聖11 / 防護7）。前21點全部點懲戒：命令聖印提供爆發，30級的懺悔可使人型生物失去行動能力，正義追擊提升速度，辯護降低目標的攻擊強度，以眼還眼對付高致命一擊的攻擊者。然後是雙手武器專精、復仇、光之勇士和聖光折射，用於聖印切換的傷害。神聖系加入強化聖印、神聖之力、不滅信仰（縮短恐懼時間）和真理之聲（6秒沉默和打斷免疫）；防護系加入堅韌和守護者的寵愛，縮短保護祝福的冷卻時間並延長自由祝福的持續時間。刻意不點清算。"
L["Two-handed Retribution that grows into a Reckoning burst build (Ret 26 / Prot 25). Levels 10-30 are a normal melee Paladin with Repentance for control, Pursuit of Justice for speed and Eye for an Eye against crit-heavy players; Vengeance follows at 31, then the Protection points, with Reckoning last (56-60). In Forever, Reckoning stores up to 4 extra attacks and releases them all on your next melee hit, so one swing becomes five. Build the stacks in a shield (blocks with Redoubt, and crits taken) without attacking, then swap to your two-hander, Seal of Command up, and land the hit; Hammer of Justice or Repentance keeps the target still for it. Below 56 it plays like a weaker Ret, since the Protection points are survival filler until Reckoning arrives."] = "逐步成長為清算爆發流的雙手懲戒（懲戒26 / 防護25）。10至30級是一般的近戰聖騎士，用懺悔控場，正義追擊提升速度，以眼還眼對付高致命一擊的玩家；31級取得復仇，然後是防護系的點數，清算放在最後（56至60級）。在 Forever 中，清算最多可儲存4次額外攻擊，並在你下一次近戰命中時全部釋放，所以一次揮擊變成五次。先拿著盾牌累積層數（靠盾牌壁壘的格擋，以及受到的致命一擊），期間不要攻擊，然後換上雙手武器，開著命令聖印打出這一擊；用制裁之錘或懺悔讓目標原地不動。56級以前它玩起來像較弱的懲戒，因為防護系的點數在取得清算之前只是保命用的填充。"
L["Two-hander Arms for leveling through dungeons. Same core as the solo build, but Sweeping Strikes comes at 30 for packs (the next five attacks also hit a second target) and Improved Heroic Strike replaces Deflection, since the tank takes the hits. On packs use Sweeping Strikes, then Whirlwind (from 36, Berserker Stance) and Cleave; on bosses Rend, Overpower and Mortal Strike. Let the tank get a few Sunders in first."] = "在地城中練功的雙手武器配置。核心與單人配置相同，但30級就點橫掃攻擊對付成群的怪（接下來五次攻擊也會擊中第二個目標），並以強化英勇打擊取代偏斜，因為由坦克承受傷害。成群的怪先用橫掃攻擊，再用旋風斬（36級起，狂暴姿態）和順劈斬；首領用撕裂、壓制和致死打擊。先讓坦克上幾次破甲。"
L["Two-hander Arms for open-world PvP and battlegrounds (Arms 31 / Fury 17 / Protection 3). Mortal Strike halves enemy healing, Sweeping Strikes and Bloodthrill Overpowers add burst, and Spearing Strike pulls riders off their mounts. Improved Hamstring, Piercing Howl and Iron Will give you control and some stun resistance, while Blood Craze heals you after big hits. Before 40 you play on Rend, Overpower, Charge and Sweeping Strikes, with Improved Tactical Mastery letting you swap stances without losing your Rage. Open with Charge, Hamstring a runner, Mortal Strike on cooldown, Execute under 20%. Best stats: Hit, Strength, Crit, then Stamina for survival."] = "適用於野外PvP和戰場的雙手武器戰（武器31 / 狂怒17 / 防護3）。致死打擊使敵方治療效果減半，橫掃攻擊和鮮血快感的壓制增加爆發，穿刺打擊可以把騎乘者打下坐騎。強化斷筋、刺耳怒吼和鋼鐵意志給你控場能力和一些抗擊昏能力，而血之狂熱會在你受到重擊後治療你。40級前你靠撕裂、壓制、衝鋒和橫掃攻擊作戰，並用強化戰術專精讓你切換姿態時不會損失怒氣。用衝鋒開場，對逃跑的人使用斷筋，致死打擊有冷卻就用，目標生命低於20%時使用斬殺。最佳屬性：命中、力量、致命一擊，然後是耐力以提高生存能力。"
L["Two-hander Arms for questing alone. Improved Rend first: keep Rend on every mob, and from 30 Bloodthrill turns your hits on a bleeding target into Overpower procs, your cheapest big hit (5 rage). Deep Wounds and Anger Management at 20, Two-Handed Specialization and Impale in the 20s, Weaponmaster with an axe or polearm, Mortal Strike at 40, then Cruelty and Unbridled Wrath for crit and rage. Spend rage on Overpower first, then Mortal Strike and Slam; finish mobs with Execute. About 11% faster than the old Arms leveling build in our model."] = "單人解任務的雙手武器配置。先點強化撕裂：讓每隻怪都保持撕裂，30級起鮮血快感會讓你對流血目標的攻擊觸發壓制，這是你最便宜的高傷害技能（5點怒氣）。20級點重傷和憤怒掌控，20多級點雙手武器專精和穿刺，用斧或長柄武器點武器大師，40級點致死打擊，然後點殘忍和怒不可遏提高致命一擊和怒氣。怒氣優先用在壓制，然後是致死打擊和猛擊；用斬殺收尾。在我們的模型中比舊的武器練功配置快約11%。"
L["Two-hander Retribution for leveling through dungeons. Same core as the solo build, plus the group tools: Repentance at 30 to take a humanoid out of a pull, and Instrument of Law at 40 (20% less threat without Righteous Fury, and an instant Hammer of Wrath) so you don't pull mobs off the tank. Holy Conduit comes early for cheaper Consecration on packs, and Purifying Power early for Exorcism against the Undead (Scarlet Monastery, Razorfen Downs, Stratholme, Scholomance). Open boss fights with Judgement of the Crusader; Seal of Command, Judgement and Holy Strike on cooldown; Consecration only once the tank holds the pack."] = "在地城中練功的雙手武器懲戒配置。核心與單人配置相同，另加上組隊工具：30級點懺悔讓一隻人型怪退出戰鬥，40級點法之公器（沒有正義之怒時仇恨降低20%，並讓憤怒之錘變為瞬發），讓你不會從坦克身上搶怪。神聖導體提早點，讓對付成群怪的奉獻更便宜；淨化能量也提早點，讓驅邪術能對付不死生物（血色修道院、剃刀高地、斯坦索姆、通靈學院）。首領戰以十字軍審判開場；冷卻好就用命令聖印、審判和神聖打擊；坦克穩住整群怪後才用奉獻。"
L["Two-hander Retribution for questing alone. Seal of Command at 20 and Sacred Arbiter at 25, then Pursuit of Justice (+15% run and mount speed) for faster travel between mobs, about 5% more kills an hour. Open every pull with Judgement of the Crusader, then Seal of Command: about 10% more kills an hour. Vengeance, Two-Handed Weapon Specialization and Champion of the Light through the 30s, Holy from 40 for Divine Strength, Improved Seals and mana. Skip Consecration on single mobs."] = "單人解任務的雙手武器懲戒配置。20級點命令聖印，25級點神聖仲裁者，然後點正義追擊（跑速和坐騎速度+15%）讓你在怪物之間移動更快，每小時擊殺數多約5%。每次開怪都先用十字軍審判，再上命令聖印：每小時擊殺數多約10%。30多級點復仇、雙手武器專精和光之勇士，40級起點神聖系的神聖之力、強化聖印和法力天賦。單隻怪不要用奉獻。"
